  lockedText: Fish first. I've been waiting all week.
  offerText: Sometimes I just want to try something a little strange... maybe I'll
    stick to just vegetables this time.
  reminderText: Just lettuce.
  exactText: I know, right? To think that a color like green is what brought us all
    the way to this very day.
  extraText: Lettuce and company. Fine by me.
